  "description": "Stop the OpenAPI document of your ASP.NET Core API from drifting away from the code. Every build writes it as JSON and YAML, and your app serves a beautiful interactive API reference for it. Connected to Routebase, the same build lints and rates the API, sets up a mock server and smoke tests, and fails when a change breaks the contract. It works with Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi, Swashbuckle and NSwag.",
